    "statement": "Write W_vee=W_0+P_cl(t A_W+B_W). In ascending Y-degree, the unit equation reconstructs every coefficient of A_W and B_W uniquely: the kth correction is the canonical residue rho_k=-C_k^0(l_0P_cl)^(-1) modulo f_0=E q_bar and must have degree at most one. A non-affine residue rejects the packet. Survivors leave only deterministic exact division and inherited degree and Hankel checks, with no correction-polynomial solver variables.",
